  "note": "Every multiplier step confirmed against the chain's own state. ERC-8056 emits UIMultiplierUpdated once, at announcement, carrying a future effectiveAt, and emits NOTHING when the change takes effect - so until an archive endpoint was found, the application was derived from the clock rather than observed. Reading uiMultiplier() at the block before effectiveAt and at the block itself makes the transition a measurement.",
